{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Unexpected closure — D-067 revision\n\nInterrupted active run = Stop.\nKeep current file edits.\nReconcile on reopening; show error popup.\n\n[[Unexpected Closure Recovery]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "reopen",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1 · Granite reopens\n\nFind durable unfinished run/outcome records.\nCompleted runs stay completed.\nNo automatic restart or tool replay.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "fence",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2 · Treat interruption as Stop\n\nInvalidate old approvals/callbacks.\nHold affected repository editing queues.\nDo not replay original tool actions.",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "popup",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3 · Error popup\n\n“Granite closed unexpectedly. Interrupted work stopped; existing changes were kept.”\n\nReport settlement and real uncertainty.\nNo restoration progress.",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "settle",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4 · Settle surviving writers\n\nClosure does not prove every child process ended.\nCancel/settle owned work.\nDetermine actual action/file outcomes.",
      "x": 1640,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "restore",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 5 · Keep current files\n\nPreserve completed and known partial edits.\nDo not restore pre-run versions or reset Git.\nAutomatic restoration is deferred.\n\n[[Things to Optimize]]",
      "x": 2200,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "verify",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 6 · Save stopped outcome\n\nReconcile execution/status records.\nKeep available diffs and interruption details.\nRepeated closure must not replay tools.",
      "x": 2780,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "done",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stopped — changes kept\n\nWriters/outcomes are settled.\nRetain history and release affected scheduling.\nUser may start new work; no automatic continuation.",
      "x": 3340,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text_only",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Text / read-only interruption\n\nSettle and mark the run stopped.\nKeep partial chat history.\nPopup reports the interruption.\nNo repository reset occurs.",
      "x": 2200,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "attention",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Outcome needs attention\n\nKeep actual files and outcome records.\nIdentify unresolved process/action effects.\nBlock affected writes for genuine uncertainty.\nNo automatic restoration is pending.",
      "x": 3340,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "completed",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Completed work stays\n\nEarlier completed runs stay completed.\nInterrupted runs retain completed edits too.\nNo pre-run file reset.",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "queued",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Queue / timer restart — agreed\n\nD-056.\nKeep pending messages; require explicit restart.\nFresh checks and queue positions.\n\n[[Restarted Queues & Timers]]",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "journal",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Necessary durable run state\n\nRecord execution, outcomes and pending work.\nRetain genuine uncertainty for reconciliation.\nNo full before-file snapshots solely for undo.",
      "x": 1640,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "restart_proposal",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Restart defaults — agreed\n\nD-056 · Accepted from P-014.\nThese extend the D-055 crash flow.\n\n[[Restarted Queues & Timers]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1020,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "pending_after_restart",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Queued messages remain\n\nShow “Not started — Granite restarted.”\nDo not dispatch automatically.\nUser runs pending messages explicitly.\nFresh validation, new run and queue position.",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 1020,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "held_timer_restart",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Previously held timer\n\nActive/queued temporary chat:\na fresh idle hour after recovery.\nRequeue → hold at 1:00:00 again.\nNo offline time deducted from a held timer.",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 1020,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "idle_timer_restart",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Already counting down\n\nExisting idle deadlines continue offline.\nAlready expired → normal cleanup.\nA restart does not revive the chat.\nOld approvals remain invalid.",
      "x": 1640,
      "y": 1020,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "recover_once",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Recover the transition once\n\nPersist recovered job/timer state.\nAnother restart must not recreate a job or repeatedly refresh expiry.\nDismissing the error popup starts no work.",
      "x": 2200,
      "y": 1020,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
